/p><p>To align with the principle of justice, the use case should implement=
 measures to assess the equity of its resource allocation strategies. This =
could involve conducting impact assessments to evaluate how different alloc=
ation scenarios affect various demographic groups and making adjustments to=
 ensure that all individuals have equitable access to services.</p><h2>4) S=
tress Tests / Edge Cases</h2><h3>Scenario 1: Algorithmic Bias</h3><p>One po=
tential edge case involves the risk of algorithmic bias in the predictive m=
odeling process. If the data used to train the models reflects existing bia=
