iciency.</p><h2>3) Principle-by-Principle Deep Critical Evaluation</h2><h3>=
Community as a Moral Reference Point</h3><p>The use case's reliance on pred=
ictive algorithms to allocate resources reflects a utilitarian approach, pr=
